age group, and geographic area, and adjusted for clustering within enumeration areas.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Preintervention and postintervention prevalence, VLS prevalence ratios (PRs), and adjusted prevalence ratios (aPRs) were estimated using SAS (version 9.3; SAS Institute).\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"VLS prevalence among persons with HIV infection, VLS PRs, and VLS aPRs were estimated with SURVEYFREQ and GENMOD procedures\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"Unless otherwise indicated, all PRs with a lower bound of the 95% CI ≥1.0 are statistically significant (p<0.05).\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Conditions included viral load suppression because of low sensitivity (77%) of self-reported ART use\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}